Document Loader for PDF, LaTeX, JSON, and plain text.

Checklist Loader for the built-in checklist and custom checklists.

Falsification Condition Checker for each condition F1 through F14.

Validation Workflow Checker for each item C1 through C16.

Reporting Standard Checker for each item S1 through S24.

Human Judgment Collector for each human judgment item.

Checklist Runner for the full checklist.

Report Builder for each report type.

Table Formatter for the table structure.

Batch Runner for multiple submissions.

Reproducibility Recorder for the record structure.

Integration tests:

Audit a document that satisfies all conditions. Verify all items pass.

Audit a document that fails a condition. Verify the condition is triggered.

Audit a document that is missing evidence. Verify the items are not_applicable.

Audit a document that requires human judgment. Verify the human judgment items are identified.

Batch audit multiple documents. Verify the batch report.

Worked-example tests:

Audit the STAG worked examples (Artifact 1, Section 11). Verify the falsification conditions, the validation workflow items, and the reporting standard items.

Audit the two-layer Ising example (Artifact 1, Section 11.2). Verify the reporting standard items S1 through S24.

Audit the Fröhlich/Eliashberg example (Artifact 1, Section 11.1). Verify the not_determinable handling.

Regression tests:

Report determinism.

Checklist consistency.

Item evaluation consistency.

